2026-05-09  swarm/ created + swarm/CLAUDE.md
  WHAT: Created swarm/ directory and swarm/CLAUDE.md. The
        CLAUDE.md captures the v2 mantra ("nail one aspect
        before moving to the next"), the ask-lots-of-clarifying-
        questions rule, and pointers to ../port.md, ../lessons.md,
        ../v2.me. Other conventions (dev_log format inside swarm,
        code style, build commands) deliberately deferred — they
        get added as we make each decision.
  WHY:  User: "the mantra of this pivot is to start incrementally
        and nail one aspect before we move into the next thing.
        Add it to the new Claude.md that I want you to ask a LOT
        of clarifying questions." Captured before any v2 code so
        future Claude reads it on session start and doesn't drift.

